    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.1.02-02",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The crude birth rate expresses live births per 1,000 population over the stated year, conventionally using a suitable mid-year population denominator. The crude death rate expresses deaths per 1,000 population over the same kind of interval and denominator. They are rates, not simple birth or death counts. A country with more births can have a lower birth rate if its population is sufficiently larger.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-2",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-2",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-2",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-2"
      ],
      "context_tags": [
        "Geography",
        "original teaching"
      ],
      "assessment_objectives": [
        "A",
        "B",
        "C"
      ],
      "claims_seen": {
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-2": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-2": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-2": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-2": 1
      },
      "authored_hash": "c648dd9df898221ba229b1a2bd907a3a97fa2afb78a15e68746b10eb0b1280f4"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.1.02-03",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A rate of thirty births per 1,000 is 3% of the population in that year, not thirty per cent. If the comparable death rate is ten per 1,000, natural increase is twenty per 1,000, equivalent to 2%. This calculation excludes migration unless it is added separately. Do not subtract a percentage from a per-thousand rate without first putting both on the same basis.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-2",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-2",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-2",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-1",
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-2"
      ],
      "context_tags": [
        "Geography",
        "original teaching"
      ],
      "assessment_objectives": [
        "A",
        "B",
        "C"
      ],
      "claims_seen": {
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-2": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-01-2": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-02-2": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-1": 1,
        "CL-6137-3.1.02-03-2": 1
